Create a new task, then dive into it and figure out how to accomplish it.

Step 0 — create the task:
{hint}- Discuss with the user as needed to pin down the goal, scope, and any properties worth setting (name, importance, project, tags, deadline, content)
- Call add_task with the agreed properties; task names start with a lowercase letter (except proper nouns)
- The returned id is your target for the steps below

Step 1 — understand the task you just created:
- get_task_info on the new task id for full metadata
- get_content on the new task id for the body (may be empty if you did not set content)

